  "id": "navigation",
  "term": "navigation",
  "definition": "Navigation is the process of finding and following a route to move from one place to another. In this context, it can be supported either by step-by-step guidance or by a simple route display, and it is linked to how people attend to their surroundings and learn spatial layouts.",
